      "refersTo": "button-danger",
      "description": "Shared Bootstrap-backed action with explicit Korean labeling.",
      "html": "<button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-danger\">AI 중지</button>",
      "css": ".ds-danger{font-family:var(--font-ui,\"Noto Sans KR Variable\",system-ui,sans-serif);font-size:14px;min-height:40px;padding:6px 12px;border:1px solid;border-radius:6px;font-weight:550;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px;line-height:1.5;cursor:pointer;transition:color .15s ease-in-out,background-color .15s ease-in-out,border-color .15s ease-in-out;color:var(--danger,#ad2735);background:transparent;border-color:#e0b6bb;}.ds-danger:hover{color:white;background:var(--danger,#ad2735);border-color:var(--danger,#ad2735);}.ds-danger:active{color:white;background:#dc3545;border-color:#dc3545;}.ds-danger:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent,#175cd3);outline-offset:3px;box-shadow:none}.ds-danger:disabled{opacity:.65;cursor:not-allowed}@media(max-width:767px){.ds-danger{min-height:44px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-danger{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Text field",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "field",
      "description": "Labeled Bootstrap-style field.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-label\" for=\"ds-channel\">채널 주소<input class=\"ds-field\" id=\"ds-channel\" placeholder=\"채널 주소 입력\"></label>",
      "css": ".ds-label{font-family:var(--font-ui,\"Noto Sans KR Variable\",system-ui,sans-serif);font-size:14px;display:block;font-weight:550;color:var(--ink,#202a39)}.ds-field{font-family:var(--font-ui,\"Noto Sans KR Variable\",system-ui,sans-serif);font-size:14px;display:block;width:calc(100% - 26px);min-height:28px;padding:6px 12px;margin-top:6px;border:1px solid #b7c2d1;border-radius:6px;color:var(--ink,#202a39);background:var(--surface,#fff)}.ds-field::placeholder{color:#68768a}.ds-field:focus{border-color:#86b7fe}.ds-field:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent,#175cd3);outline-offset:3px;box-shadow:none}@media(max-width:767px){.ds-field{min-height:30px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Task navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "navigation-active",
      "description": "Current task is identified by text, icon and aria-current.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"운영 화면\"><a class=\"ds-nav-link\" href=\"#broadcast\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"/><path d=\"M16.24 7.76a6 6 0 0 1 0 8.48m-8.48 0a6 6 0 0 1 0-8.48M19.07 4.93a10 10 0 0 1 0 14.14m-14.14 0a10 10 0 0 1 0-14.14\"/></svg>라이브</a><a class=\"ds-nav-link\" href=\"#connections\">방송 준비</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:grid;gap:6px}.ds-nav-link{font-family:var(--font-ui,\"Noto Sans KR Variable\",system-ui,sans-serif);font-size:14px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;min-height:26px;padding:10px 14px;color:var(--muted,#596579);text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px}.ds-nav-link[aria-current]{background:var(--accent-soft,#eaf1ff);color:var(--accent,#175cd3);font-weight:650}.ds-nav-link:hover{background:var(--surface-subtle,#f0f3f7)}.ds-nav-link:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent,#175cd3);outline-offset:3px;box-shadow:none}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Success badge",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "status-success",
      "description": "A noninteractive label for positive state.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-badge\">세션 진행 중</span>",
      "css": ".ds-badge{font-family:var(--font-ui,\"Noto Sans KR Variable\",system-ui,sans-serif);font-size:14px;display:inline-flex;gap:5px;align-items:center;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;font-weight:600;border-radius:5px;padding:3px 8px;color:var(--success,#176044);background:var(--success-soft,#e9f6ef);white-space:nowrap}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Workspace card",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "card",
      "description": "Flat bordered surface for a grouped task.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-card\"><h2 class=\"ds-card-title\">방송 준비</h2><p class=\"ds-card-copy\">입력부터 AI 모델, OBS 출력까지 연결을 준비하세요.</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-card{font-family:var(--font-ui,\"Noto Sans KR Variable\",system-ui,sans-serif);font-size:14px;background:var(--surface,#fff);color:var(--ink,#202a39);border:1px solid var(--line,#dce2ea);border-radius:8px;padding:20px}.ds-card-title{font-size:17px;line-height:1.4;font-weight:650;margin:0 0 16px}.ds-card-copy{color:var(--muted,#596579);line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 12px}@media(max-width:767px){.ds-card{padding:16px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Section tabs",
      "kind": "nav",
      "description": "Static preview of shared section tabs. The application owns keyboard behavior and mounted-panel lifetimes; test microphone controls remain outside tabs.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"방송 준비\"><button class=\"ds-tab\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\">입력</button><button class=\"ds-tab\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">AI 모델</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-tabs{display:flex;gap:4px;flex-wrap:wrap;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#dce2ea)}.ds-tab{font-family:var(--font-ui,\"Noto Sans KR Variable\",system-ui,sans-serif);font-size:14px;min-height:44px;padding:10px 16px;border:0;border-bottom:2px solid transparent;background:transparent;color:var(--muted,#596579);font-weight:550;cursor:pointer}.ds-tab[aria-selected=\"true\"]{color:var(--accent,#175cd3);border-bottom-color:var(--accent,#175cd3)}.ds-tab:hover{color:var(--accent,#175cd3);background:var(--accent-soft,#eaf1ff)}.ds-tab:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent,#175cd3);outline-offset:3px;box-shadow:none}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Overlay message",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "overlay-message",
      "description": "Synthetic example of a dark translucent OBS message row.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-overlay\"><div class=\"ds-avatar\">예</div><div class=\"ds-content\"><strong class=\"ds-author\">예시 참여자</strong><p class=\"ds-message\">미리보기 대화입니다.</p></div></article>",
      "css": ".ds-overlay{font-family:var(--font-ui,\"Noto Sans KR Variable\",system-ui,sans-serif);font-size:14px;display:flex;gap:12px;background:#162133ed;color:#f7f9fc;border-radius:8px;padding:12px 14px}.ds-avatar{display:grid;place-items:center;flex:0 0 32px;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#32496b;color:#e4edff;font-size:13px;font-weight:650}.ds-content{min-width:0}.ds-author{font-size:13px}.ds-message{font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;margin:5px 0 0}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Test session microphone controls",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Persistent session controls above the conversation, per-viewer state and call-detail tabs; usage is a count, not a generation cap.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-test-controls\" aria-label=\"마이크 입력\"><div class=\"ds-test-heading\"><h2>마이크 입력</h2><span>AI 호출 2회</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-test-microphone\">마이크로 말하기</button><p>탭을 바꿔도 계속 듣습니다.</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-test-controls{font-family:var(--font-ui,\"Noto Sans KR Variable\",system-ui,sans-serif);background:var(--surface,#fff);color:var(--ink,#202a39);border:1px solid var(--line,#dce2ea);border-radius:8px;padding:20px}.ds-test-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:14px}.ds-test-heading h2{font-size:17px;font-weight:650;line-height:1.4;margin:0}.ds-test-heading span,.ds-test-controls p{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted,#596579)}.ds-test-controls p{margin:0;line-height:1.6}.ds-test-microphone{font:550 14px/1.5 var(--font-ui,\"Noto Sans KR Variable\",system-ui,sans-serif);min-height:40px;padding:6px 12px;border:1px solid #c6cfdb;border-radius:6px;background:var(--surface,#fff);color:#40516b;cursor:pointer}.ds-test-microphone:hover{background:#edf1f6;color:var(--ink,#202a39);border-color:#a7b5c8}.ds-test-microphone:active{background:#e1e8f2}.ds-test-microphone:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent,#175cd3);outline-offset:3px}.ds-test-microphone:disabled{opacity:.65;cursor:not-allowed}@media(max-width:767px){.ds-test-controls{padding:16px}.ds-test-microphone{min-height:44px}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Broadcast Desk",
    "overview": "The broadcast desk is a compact, familiar operating environment. White work surfaces sit on a cool slate canvas; blue identifies actions and selection, while concise labels and restrained status colors keep attention on the conversation and immediate controls.\n\nThe system uses packaged Bootstrap CSS, Radix Tabs, Lucide icons and locally packaged Noto Sans KR. Native modal dialogs provide confirmation behavior compatible with the application CSP. The reader shares the light workspace language; the OBS overlay uses translucent dark message surfaces over a transparent page.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Task-oriented navigation with compact desktop density.",
      "Korean-readable typography and explicit action labels.",
      "Flat bordered surfaces with restrained semantic color.",
      "Persistent mobile navigation and emergency AI stop."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The State Has Words Rule",
        "body": "Every operating state carries a readable label; semantic color reinforces it.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Flat Workspace Rule",
        "body": "Routine surfaces use borders and tonal separation; the modal confirmation owns the large shadow.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do reuse the shared Bootstrap-backed controls, Radix Tabs and Lucide icons.",
      "Do pair status color with explicit text and preserve visible keyboard focus.",
      "Do keep emergency AI stop reachable in the mobile sticky header.",
      "Do retain Korean UI labels, local font assets and the transparent OBS page.",
      "Do preserve mounted tab content and distinguish tab activation from setup deep links when moving focus."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't turn routine cards into elevated promotional surfaces.",
      "Don't use color or an icon alone to explain an operating state.",
      "Don't move focus during routine status refreshes.",
      "Don't apply the light canvas background to the OBS overlay.",
      "Don't treat generated palette ramps in the sidecar as implemented CSS tokens."
    ]
  }
}
